                                                "sense_id": "7661db43-6ac8-3759-ab56-66234f17bcac",
                                                "text": "In Walachia, green sods are laid on the window-sills and on the lintels of the doors to avert the uncanny crew [i.e. witches]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
